      'answer',E'1',
      'explanation',E'who = and she (계속적 용법 = 접속사 + 대명사)'),
    jsonb_build_object('number',13,
      'question',E'다음 중 주어진 문장과 의미가 같은 것을 고르시오.\n\nHe skipped breakfast again, which his doctor had warned him not to do.',
